        "content": "\ud83d\udea8 At Consensus Miami 2026, @calilyliu shared a clear vision for Solana:<br>Not competing to be \u201canother Ethereum,\u201d but positions itself as the financial infrastructure for both the human and machine economy.<br><br>And the signals are already here<br>@WesternUnion launched USDPT on Solana. @Visa  settles USDC on Solana. @Shopify  processes stablecoin payments through Solana. @PayPal, @stripe , @CashApp, and @SoFi are all integrating deeper into the ecosystem.<br><br>@Solana is rapidly becoming the settlement layer for the next era of digital payments \u2014 built for both humans and AI agents<br><img src=\"https://static.sosovalue.com/2026/05/10/329b1fa1-cbec-45f1-8ed5-35e4b264a1b2.jpg\"/>",
