        "quote_info": {
          "content": "SOLANA ACCELERATE MIAMI 2026  \ud83c\udf1f\n\nBig banks, TradFi, AI, and builders all-in on @Solana.\nHere are the biggest updates:\n\n\ud83d\udd38@StateStreet ($5T+ AUM) + @galaxyhq  just launched SWEEP \u2014 the first tokenized onchain liquidity fund on Solana. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@Anchorage + JPM Asset Management rolled out tokenized solutions for stablecoin reserves. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@jito_sol dropped @jtx_trade \u2014 a self-custodial trading platform with CEX-level execution, TradingView charts, and portfolio tools. Spot live now.\n\n\ud83d\udd38@moonpay acquired @dflow  in a $100M all-stock deal. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@TAO_dot_com\u2019 $TAO is now native on Solana via Wormhole. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@RaposaCoffeeCo (Solana NFT project) became official coffee partner of Miami Heat & Marlins. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@Securitize, @jumptrading & @JupiterExchange launched fully onchain regulated trading for tokenized equities. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@SoFi is bringing its regulated stablecoin SoFiUSD to Solana. \n\n\ud83d\udd38@jump_firedancer started rolling out Firedancer 1.0 \u2014 the new high-performance validator client for Solana.\n\n\ud83d\udd38New machine-native commerce marketplace for AI agents, powered by @googlecloud  + @moonpay  onramp.\n\n\ud83d\udd38@privy_io rolled out Digital Asset Accounts on Solana \u2014 built for fintech, trading & consumer apps.\n\n\ud83d\udd38@Bullish  tokenized 151M shares on Solana. \n\nTradFi, AI agents, and consumer apps are converging hard on Solana. \n\nWhich update excited you the most? \ud83d\udc47",
