        "content": "\"5 Golden Opportunities I Found Using Vibe Coding in the Crypto World\" (Author: Ronin; Translated by AididiaoJP) This article focuses on the application of AI and vibe coding in the crypto industry, proposing 4 types of feasible directions: centralized and decentralized exchange arbitrage robots, prediction market arbitrage tools, on-chain data aggregators, and automated private message sales agents. It also provides a detailed analysis of their technical architecture, risks, and promotion logic. AI has significantly lowered the barrier to entry for individual developers, but the real difficulty lies not in the code, but in market demand, product structure, and long-term execution. Most people overestimate the possibility of getting rich quickly in the short term, but underestimate the importance of continuously accumulating experience and social capital. Read more:",
