        "content": "Matthew Sigel, VanEck\u2019s Head of Digital Asset Research, told CNBC that although Bitcoin has pulled back nearly 50% from its 2025 high, he expects BTC to return to its all-time high within the next 12 months. Sigel believes current market sentiment remains cautious\u2014more akin to short-covering than extreme optimism\u2014suggesting further upside potential. Additionally, he notes that if the Clarity Act passes, it could accelerate institutional capital inflows into the crypto market; however, he remains cautious on altcoins overall and is more bullish on Bitcoin and AI-driven mining opportunities.",
