        "content": "\"The Missing Piece of DeFi: Analyzing the History and Future Direction of On-Chain Options\" (Author: @alphaomegacat; Translated and Edited by Wu Blockchain)  \nThe long-term development of crypto options has fallen short of expectations. The core issue is not the absence of tools, but rather that the market has over-invested in building a professional trading layer while neglecting idle capital\u2014such as spot holders, DAO treasuries, LSTs, and long-term large holders\u2014that can truly generate scalable order flow.",
